#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-app-deployment.rst:7
msgid ""
"The Mattermost mobile app is available for iPhone and Android devices, "
"and provides a native experience on the go, ensuring you can stay "
"connected and productive from anywhere."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 모바일 앱은 iPhone과 Android 기기에서 사용할 수 있으며, 이동 중에도 "
"네이티브 경험을 제공하여 어디서든 연결된 상태로 생산성을 유지할 수 있도록 "
"합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-app-deployment.rst:9
msgid ""
"Learn more about :ref:`mobile app software requirements <deployment-guide"
"/software-hardware-requirements:mobile apps>`, :doc:`available releases "
"and server compatibility </product-overview/mattermost-mobile-releases>`,"
" :doc:`what's changed across releases </product-overview/mobile-app-"
"changelog>`, and :doc:`commonly asked questions </deployment-guide/mobile"
"/mobile-faq>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`모바일 앱 소프트웨어 요구 사항 <deployment-guide/software-hardware-"
"requirements:mobile apps>`, :doc:`사용 가능한 릴리스와 서버 호환성 </product-"
"overview/mattermost-mobile-releases>`, :doc:`릴리스별 변경 사항 </product-"
"overview/mobile-app-changelog>`, :doc:`자주 묻는 질문 </deployment-"
"guide/mobile/mobile-faq>`\\ 에 대해 자세히 알아보세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-app-deployment.rst:12
msgid "Download"
msgstr "다운로드"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-app-deployment.rst:14
msgid ""
"Download and install the Mattermost mobile app from the `Apple App Store "
"(iOS) <https://www.apple.com/app-store/>`__ or `Google Play Store "
"(Android) <https://play.google.com/store/games?hl=en>`__. When new mobile"
" app releases become available, your mobile app is automatically updated."
msgstr ""
"`Apple App Store(iOS) <https://www.apple.com/app-store/>`__ 또는 `Google "
"Play Store(Android) <https://play.google.com/store/games?hl=en>`__\\ 에서 "
"OKR.BEST 모바일 앱을 다운로드하여 설치하세요. 새 모바일 앱 릴리스가 출시되면 "
"모바일 앱이 자동으로 업데이트됩니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-app-deployment.rst:16
msgid ""
"If you prefer to manage distribution of the mobile app to your users, we "
"recommend using an :doc:`EMM provider </deployment-guide/mobile/deploy-"
"mobile-apps-using-emm-provider>` to maintain full control over the "
"distribution process, as well as enforce or restrict specific security "
"policies. See the deployment options below for details."
msgstr ""
"사용자에게 모바일 앱 배포를 직접 관리하고 싶다면, 배포 과정을 완전히 "
"통제하고 특정 보안 정책을 적용하거나 제한하기 위해 :doc:`EMM 공급자 "
"</deployment-guide/mobile/deploy-mobile-apps-using-emm-provider>`\\ 를 "
"사용할 것을 권장합니다. 자세한 내용은 아래 배포 옵션을 참고하세요."

